# Text files are checked out with LF on every system, so that the build scripts, which read sources by lines, work on Windows (#2610).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pbf binary
*.pmtiles binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.gz binary
*.zip binary
